#: src/Form/SettingsFieldset.php:76
msgid ""
"Ips or cidr ranges (space or comma separated) of the reverse proxies in "
"front of the server (Traefik, Nginx, Varnish…). The headers X-Forwarded-For "
"and X-Real-IP are read only when the direct peer matches this list, so the "
"trackers receive the ip of the visitor and not the one of the proxy. Empty "
"means no proxy."
msgstr ""

